  "releaseNotes": "1.0.1\n- Android: updated Yandex Mobile Ads SDK from 7.18.6 to 8.6.0 (AppMetrica 8.5.1).\n- Android: removed dependencies the SDK no longer uses (DivKit, Yatagan, AndroidSVG, Media3 ExoPlayer), which makes apps smaller.\n- Breaking (Android): SDK 8 renamed MobileAds to YandexAds. Apps must call YandexAds.Initialize(...) instead of MobileAds.Initialize(...).\n\n1.0.0\n- Initial release.",
